thread:
Iris Park: opened a small PR for onprem installer subnet reallocation docs. adds preflight checks, HSM tunnel example, and a Node.js SDK snippet. https://github.com/redwood/docs/pull/4802

Ben Walton: nice. can you add a compact preflight checklist we can paste into support runbooks? especially IP overlap and MTU checks.

Iris Park: yep. draft checklist in PR: 1) confirm non-overlapping CIDRs between customer VPC and private nodes; 2) verify HSM gateway IP is reachable from an installer host; 3) check MTU and enable tcp_mtu_probing if fragmentation suspected.

Maya Singh: include a short HSM tunnel (ssh local port forward) example for air-gapped prep so customers can test KMS calls before flipping routes. one-liner please.

Iris Park: added one-liner: `ssh -L 127.0.0.1:4731:10.20.0.5:4731 ops@bastion.example.com -N` and note to keep tunnel alive with autossh in production testing.

Ben Walton: also add nftables/iptables quick checks to allow 4731 outbound only from installer hosts. keep one-liners.

Iris Park: added: `iptables -I OUTPUT -p tcp --dport 4731 -d 10.20.0.5 -j ACCEPT` and `nft add rule ip filter output tcp dport 4731 ip daddr 10.20.0.5 accept`.

Maya Singh: SDK snippets: we have python/go/java covered; add Node.js minimal example that points at sidecar for local testing.

Iris Park: Node snippet added:```js
const { Client } = require('redwood');
const client = new Client({ apiKey: 'REDACTED', baseURL: 'http://127.0.0.1:8080' });
(async () => {
  const res = await client.generate('test');
  console.log(res.text);
})();
```

docs-link-bot: ERROR: PR 4802 link-check found broken internal link to /private/install/subnets. Please update to /private/vpc/subnet-guidelines.

Iris Park: thanks bot. updated cross-links and added a short redirect note. also included a migration note: when reassigning subnets, update static ip mappings in installer-config and any iptables rules referencing old addresses.

Ben Walton: add a small troubleshooting tip: symptom = "KMS connections succeed from bastion but fail from private-nodes" -> likely NAT or egress policy. suggest tcpdump on node and check conntrack.

Iris Park: added troubleshooting snippet and a quick Loki query example to count failed tls handshakes: `|~ "tls handshake" | count_over_time(5m)`.

Maya Singh: quick nit: warn against exposing the HSM port to public subnets; add firewall example restricting source CIDR.

Iris Park: added security note and SG example. merging after docs CI. will follow up if support sees migration tickets. :shipit:
